WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:13.400
7:40 am. Before the doors open.

2
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:22.600
Done by the team. Initialled as it’s done.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:35.600
Checked by the manager. Signed off.

4
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:44.400
Every server. Every bartender. One view.

5
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:55.200
A new colleague. A full program on day one.

6
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:10.200
Rung in right. Checked by the trainer.

7
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:35.200
Graded on the floor. Signed by both.

8
00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:45.200
Trainee, trainer, manager. All on record.

9
00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:53.200
The menu changes. So does the training.

10
00:01:55.200 --> 00:02:03.800
Knowledge, checked. Not assumed.

11
00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:12.300
Setting the standard. Always going above and beyond.

12
00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:23.200
A target worth hitting.

13
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:41.600
After the last table. The work nobody sees.

14
00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:57.600
11:52 pm. Closed to standard.
